 <shortdesc>Concatenate and Variable Shift Packed Data Right Logical</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1046259">
   <string>Concatenate packed data, extract result shifted to the right by variable value.</string></para>
  <para unique="1046260">
   <string>This instruction supports memory fault suppression.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
